+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Running ${PKGSTEM} on OpenBSD
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The port creates a user _abagnale with home directory /var/abagnale. Maintenance
should be done by switching to that user.

Preparing the database
======================

The database schema will transfer all ownership to the abagnale database role.
That role must be created before creating the database.

	# su - _postgresql
	$ psql -U postgresql
		CREATE ROLE abagnale;

Create the database by loading the SQL dump:

  # su - _postgresql
  $ psql -U postgresql -f /usr/local/share/abagnale/database-postgresql.sql

The service then can be enabled and started by issueing:

# rcctl enable ${PKGSTEM}
# rcctl start ${PKGSTEM}

